      "evidence": "The page calls the delta and constant function “the two extremisers … at every length N.” Under the current unitary DFT definition, h=1_{ {0,2} } on Z/4 satisfies (F_4 h)(k)=1/2(1+e^{-πik}), which is 1 for even k and 0 for odd k. Thus F_4 h=h and its support product is 2·2=4=N, although h is neither the delta nor the constant function. The wording falsely suggests an exhaustive classification.",
